{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t荃灣天保大樓地下一間餐廳，下午5時許起火冒煙，濃煙一度席捲半空，消防到場後迅速將火救熄，初步調查相信爐頭搶火引起火警，事件無可疑。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n事發後，多名餐廳職員和樓上住戶自行疏散，一名居住在大樓上層院舍的90歲男子，懷疑不適送仁濟醫院治理。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：鍾慧儀\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T14:01:08.886940+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":123,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T13:26:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T17:38:34.422659+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T13:58:38.444485+00:00","content_hash":"df1c6f6e3f8ab9fa38e725dc1eef074a7f2870a2a8def80d7d6dc195008d8619","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}